Readout pairs one measured value with its method and a short explanation.

- Markup: `<div class="aq-readout">` with a left `aq-stack` (`<span class="aq-readout__value">` and an `aq-eyebrow` naming the method) and a right `<p class="aq-lead">`.
- Use only real, sourced measurements. Until one exists, show a placeholder in square brackets so it can't ship by accident.
- One readout per page. Values are mono with tabular figures and always carry their unit.
- The value is set at 56/60 px (40/44 px in narrow containers) in `flow`, so one number per page carries the emphasis. Use at most one Readout per page.
